{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/bundle_sheets_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:34:48.139478Z","id":"782d3030385617037d3611545c22b42270e7c6a97841edfd426e19d337b929cf","body":{"detail":"_redrawn carries iconChange 'Its icon broke Clax's icon rules, so Clax redrew it.' but no svg, so bundle-install-icon and bundle-update-icon (target/flutter-app/shots/bundle-*-icon-*.png) show the 'PL' word tile under a sentence saying Clax redrew the icon; BundleSummary.of (apps/clax_app/lib/ui/bundle_sheets.dart) passes the redrawn svg in that case and draws the word only when the icon is left out. The second sentence ('... so Clax left it out.') is covered by test/ui/bundle_flows_test.dart's text find but has no shot. The sentence itself sits well in light and dark on phone, wide and Mac: a small muted paragraph after the capabilities (install) or the data note (update), above the actions.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":59},"end":{"line":68},"content_hash":"e941139aeb355ed5df4e1620034c201db769c90024d2e98effe733ed547d9bfd"},"suggested_fix":"Give _redrawn a small passing svg, and add a _leftOut summary (no svg, the left-out sentence) with its install or update shot.","summary":"The redrawn-icon shots draw the word tile, as a left-out icon would look; no shot shows the left-out sentence","tags":["review","shots","icon","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/bundle_sheets_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T08:11:57.291215Z","id":"95f23f20968472474a9b750467f9e908495200242aefa57a61aee0367ae78d94","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Fixed in f1c07f346b12: _redrawn carries a redrawn svg, so bundle-install-icon and bundle-update-icon draw the leaf icon; new _leftOut shots bundle-install-icon-left-out and bundle-update-icon-left-out draw the word tile under 'so Clax left it out.'. bazel test //apps/clax_app:ui_shots_bundle_sheets_shots_test with CLAX_SHOTS_DIR=target/flutter-app/shots passes; bundle-install-icon-phone-light, bundle-update-icon-phone-dark, bundle-install-icon-left-out-phone-dark and bundle-update-icon-left-out-wide-light read: icon and sentence legible in both themes.","supersedes":"782d3030385617037d3611545c22b42270e7c6a97841edfd426e19d337b929cf","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/consent_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T17:15:54.254854Z","id":"644d7855e6106b680164dc85e7b7aebad40984b8624ed7a96f4e7d30c4b525e4","body":{"detail":"bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_shots_consent_shots_test --test_filter=consent-read-always --test_env=CLAX_SHOTS_DIR=$PWD/target/flutter-app/shots --sandbox_writable_path=$PWD/target/flutter-app/shots: phone and wide pass, consent-read-always-mac-light and -mac-dark FAIL with 'Found 0 widgets with text \"Always for this app\"' (tap). The mac form's read-consent dialog shows the choice under other words or not at all; the shot or the dialog needs to follow.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":64},"end":{"line":72},"content_hash":"f2bbfd5e8d3565c1c2254630708c16c1ad87722c54ec593a55f82a89fe560ecd"},"summary":"The consent-read-always shot fails in the mac form: 'Always for this app' is not found to tap","tags":["shots","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/merge_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T05:21:01.683142Z","id":"4b62b23dd70088b171c94af7baffe0086fbbcf3573a045fce956175784dddff5","body":{"detail":"grep -rln 'ConnectSheet\\|ShareSheet\\|RemoteCard\\|LibraryScreen\\|PublishedSheet' apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots finds none; only merge_shots_test.dart (diverged, update, merged offer, Tell @owner, pill, launcher badges) and consent_shots_test.dart (author trust, approval) render the branch's new surfaces. The Share sheet is the densest of them (an add row of picker, Spacer and Add; per-person rows with a picker; a Wrap of two pickers) and the card has an unconstrained pill beside its title.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":6},"content_hash":"8b85fef93ab8cb6a24250111fbbf4b0552f25a61142fda44c1d07937eedbfe38"},"suggested_fix":"Add remote_shots_test.dart rendering those five surfaces in every form and theme, at 130% and 200% text on the phone form.","summary":"No shot renders the connect sheet, the Share sheet, the On clax.dev card, the published sheet or Get my apps, so their phone-width and dark layouts are unverified","tags":["review","review:app-push-pull-deep","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/merge_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T05:24:23.469376Z","id":"20f2eabf23a29815ca909fb7966172d43db4de516cf84c2c2b2d3f3c8eafe7d5","body":{"detail":"grep -rln 'ConnectSheet\\|ShareSheet\\|RemoteCard\\|LibraryScreen\\|PublishedSheet\\|showShareSheet\\|remote_card\\|share_sheet' apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots matches only apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/.qual. The classes exist (ConnectSheet, ShareSheet, LibraryScreen, RemoteCard, PublishedSheet under apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/). Of the shots, only merge_shots_test.dart and consent_shots_test.dart mention remote surfaces.","kind":"comment","references":"4b62b23dd70088b171c94af7baffe0086fbbcf3573a045fce956175784dddff5","summary":"confirmed: no shot test renders ConnectSheet, ShareSheet, RemoteCard, LibraryScreen or PublishedSheet","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/merge_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:22:28.942779Z","id":"8f850f75a4eb436042116511239f4137c1df4bf525c12a8530230a1aae6ea65c","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:b93c4d42f","summary":"Fixed in b93c4d42f. Test: apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/remote_shots_test.dart renders the connect sheet, the Share sheet (top and end), the On clax.dev card, the published sheet and Get my apps in every form and theme and on the phone at 130% and 200% (//apps/clax_app:ui_shots_remote_shots_test with CLAX_SHOTS_DIR). Layout found and fixed: a missing-glyph box for 🔒 in the published sheet (e30989a24, test 'the published sheet says who can open it in words alone…' in test/ui/publish_sheet_test.dart); at 200% a long login broken mid-word beside its picker and the add row overflowing a 352 dp sheet (test 'at large text a person's access picker goes under their name…' in test/ui/share_sheet_test.dart). bazelisk test of the 30 touched //apps/clax_app test targets with //apps/clax_app:dart_analyze and //scripts:check_copy at b93c4d42f: 'Executed 25 out of 32 tests: 32 tests pass.' Mutation: with share_sheet.dart put back, the large-text test fails; with the two publish sheets put back, 3 publish_sheet tests fail.","supersedes":"4b62b23dd70088b171c94af7baffe0086fbbcf3573a045fce956175784dddff5","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/consent_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:22:29.027940Z","id":"b14d6725ba5ebb350ecdb4426e4d9ee5a9715ecfb16c35ffe2cb82835e926ad2","body":{"detail":"bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_shots_consent_shots_test with CLAX_SHOTS_DIR set (at 1eb330c6d) fails consent-read-always-mac-light and consent-read-always-mac-dark: 'Found 0 widgets with text \"Always for this app\"' at consent_shots_test.dart:74 (s.tester.tap). The other forms pass. Nothing under apps/clax_app/lib/ui on this branch touches the read consent, so the failure predates it; the test is skipped without CLAX_SHOTS_DIR, so no gate sees it.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":66},"end":{"line":76},"content_hash":"bb2279f5dc9e90cea6f92c365cc56758d10cfd7fc91222ec098da204ccc6f64d"},"summary":"consent-read-always fails in the mac form: it taps a text 'Always for this app' that the Mac form does not draw","tags":["test","shots","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/consent_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:30:59.156070Z","id":"e8e2b058519be7d41f7c382b93a597f49e793b8dc5e45d8d94923c497f5644ff","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:ae5615422f3d57e78aaabb07eb79d2aeb5802212","summary":"The test was wrong: ClaxDialog.ask without content is an NSAlert sheet on the Mac (hasDesktopWindowChrome, NativeDialogs.alert), which flutter_test cannot draw, so consent-read-mac-* rendered the bare page and consent-read-always-mac-* found no checkbox. consent-read and consent-read-always now render on phone, wide and iphone, as ask_prompt_shots_test does. bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_shots_consent_shots_test --nocache_test_results --test_env=CLAX_SHOTS_DIR=<worktree>/target/flutter-app/shots --sandbox_writable_path=<same>: 1 test passes (before: consent-read-always-mac-light/-dark FAIL 'Found 0 widgets with text \"Always for this app\"'); consent-read-always-iphone-light and -wide-dark show the box ticked and the button reading Always allow.","supersedes":"b14d6725ba5ebb350ecdb4426e4d9ee5a9715ecfb16c35ffe2cb82835e926ad2","tags":["session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/shots/consent_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:30:59.223058Z","id":"4a9bffd07cbcb0c5c1df6ab27862ee39b7a6dd98421f61c285d6ad43db3ffeb8","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:ae5615422f3d57e78aaabb07eb79d2aeb5802212","summary":"The test was wrong: ClaxDialog.ask without content is an NSAlert sheet on the Mac (hasDesktopWindowChrome, NativeDialogs.alert), which flutter_test cannot draw, so consent-read-mac-* rendered the bare page and consent-read-always-mac-* found no checkbox. consent-read and consent-read-always now render on phone, wide and iphone, as ask_prompt_shots_test does. bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_shots_consent_shots_test --nocache_test_results --test_env=CLAX_SHOTS_DIR=<worktree>/target/flutter-app/shots --sandbox_writable_path=<same>: 1 test passes (before: consent-read-always-mac-light/-dark FAIL 'Found 0 widgets with text \"Always for this app\"'); consent-read-always-iphone-light and -wide-dark show the box ticked and the button reading Always allow.","supersedes":"644d7855e6106b680164dc85e7b7aebad40984b8624ed7a96f4e7d30c4b525e4","tags":["session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
